    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d741">

                <pb facs="0608" n="492" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg492"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/23494.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Mediators to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Argentine Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-04-28">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 28, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary of State</hi>: It gives us
                    satisfaction to inform your excellency that we have received the acceptance of
                    General Huerta’s Government of our tender of good offices made through his
                    excellency the Ambassador of Spain.</p>
                <p>We are also glad to announce to your excellency that we made the same tender by
                    telegraph to the Chief of the Constitutionalist forces.<anchor n="20"
                        xml:id="d741-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>As a consequence of the acceptance of those good offices by your excellency’s
                    Government as well as by that of General Huerta, we <pb facs="0609" n="493"
                        xml:id="pg493"/> understand that it is proper to suspend from this time, and
                    during the mediatory action, the hostilities and military movements by the
                    forces of both parties.</p>
                <p>We avail [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">D. da Gama</hi>.</item>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">E. S. Naón</hi>.</item>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ed’o Suárez Mujica</hi>
                            </item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d741-f1" n="20" xml:id="d741-f1-content">
                <p>See post, Inclosure 1 with the Special Commissioners’ despatch No. 8, May 31.</p>
            </note>
